                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9962884b-1865-3057-b1e7-0eea4ce4fb72",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any plant of several genera of the taxonomic family Fabaceae that produces large edible seeds or edible seedpods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d07c97b4-1d99-4a19-af52-a30abfb7092b",
                                                "sense_id": "9962884b-1865-3057-b1e7-0eea4ce4fb72",
                                                "text": "2004, T. N. Shivenanda, B. R. V. Iyengar, Phosphorus Management in French Bean (Phaseolus Vulgaris L.), Ramdane Dris, S. Mohan Jain (editors), Production Practices and Quality Assessment of Food Crops, Volume 2: Plant Mineral Nutrition and Pesticide Management, page 79,\nBeans are a large group of leguminous vegetables that serve as a main source of proteins in human diet. This group comprises several species and some of them are Adzuki bean (Vigna angularis); Broad bean (Vicia faba); Cluster bean (Cyamposis tetragonoloba); French bean (Phaseolus vulgaris); […] ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70568cdf-9861-3519-bd3c-e5b8adc39e10",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The large edible seed of such a plant (for example, a broad bean, navy bean, or garbanzo bean)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d88b6698-54f7-37a4-95a5-c27c3794d1b3",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The edible seedpod of such a plant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36a733a9-6ef0-46e7-90e3-1ca1b6a30aec",
                                                "sense_id": "d88b6698-54f7-37a4-95a5-c27c3794d1b3",
                                                "text": "Green beans, also called French beans, can be pickled."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d3cb253-c8f7-3281-a1f5-ee515e44b57a",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The bean-like seed of certain other plants, such as a vanilla bean or (especially) a coffee bean."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c57b8c8d-0a79-3445-8ab4-48e0378e799d",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object resembling a pea or bean in shape, often made from plastic or styrofoam and used in large numbers as packing material or as stuffing for beanbags and similar items."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbe3d157-e331-3785-84b2-1dff1f4fa769",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The head or brain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37170291-2edc-4892-a11d-39a386847a74",
                                                "sense_id": "dbe3d157-e331-3785-84b2-1dff1f4fa769",
                                                "text": "Now, there was a perfectly sound forecast for you. Certainly a case of using the old bean. The surmise was perfectly logical."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ce82975-8a7d-407a-9bf2-a80b247ad7c9",
                                                "sense_id": "dbe3d157-e331-3785-84b2-1dff1f4fa769",
                                                "text": "I saw her quiver and kept a wary eye on the ginger ale bottle. But even if she had raised it and brought it down on [my] bean, I couldn't have been more stunned than I was by the words that left her lips.\n[...]\n Well, as I say, it was from his fertile bean that the idea sprang."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37925b47-1718-377d-8105-370714e2140c",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The human clitoris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22df44f0-1b18-48a3-91a3-7da935fcacc6",
                                                "sense_id": "37925b47-1718-377d-8105-370714e2140c",
                                                "text": "For one, don't stage a full-frontal assault on her bean."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "471b4935-65c4-3d93-adb4-3fa06dd4bff3",
                                        "entry_id": "e13a3919-bd52-3031-a08b-8d781087cb12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person; especially, a baby."
